<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Randfontein, W Areas pass divs.</title>
<headline>Randfontein, W Areas pass divs.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>South African gold mining firms Randfontein Estates Gold Mining Co Witwatersrand Ltd and Western Areas Gold Mining Co Ltd said on Wednesday that they had decided to pass their final dividends in respect of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>They said this decision followed a continuing depressed gold price and inadequate production results.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom 27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
